        //Detective Pikachu

        "Search Goldenrod City for clues.":
        "Busca pistas en Ciudad Trigal.",
        "Defeat the Aipoms":
        "Derrota a los Aipom",
        "The Aipoms dropped some sort of vial while they were running away. It looks like they were headed towards the Radio Tower. Find it!":
        "Los Aipom dejaron caer un frasco mientras huían. Parece que se dirigían a la Torre Radio. ¡Encuéntralo!",
        "[[pokemon::Detective Pikachu]] has an informant who knows more about the mysterious vial. Meet with him in Saffron City.":
        "[[pokemon::Detective Pikachu]] tiene un informante que sabe más sobre el misterioso frasco. Encuéntralo en Ciudad Azafrán.",
        "The informant is proving hard to convince. Time to get physical!":
        "Convencer al informante está siendo difícil. ¡Hora de ponerse rudos!",
        "The informant is finally willing to \"talk\", find out what he has to say.":
        "El informante finalmente está dispuesto a \"hablar\", descubre lo que tiene que decir.",
        "Infiltrate the underground fighting ring.":
        "¡Infíltrate en el ring de peleas subterráneo!",
        "Go to Clifford Industries in Goldenrod City to demand some answers.":
        "Ve a Industrias Clifford en Ciudad Trigal para exigir respuestas.",
        "Meet up with investigative journalist Lucy Stevens in Hearthome City":
        "Encuentra a la periodista investigativa Lucy Stevens en Ciudad Corazón",
        "Search the research laboratory for clues.":
        "Busca pistas en el laboratorio de investigación.",
        "It was an ambush! You have been followed to Nuvema Town, defeat the mysterious attackers and escape!":
        "¡Fue una emboscada! Te han seguido hasta Pueblo Arcilla, derrota a los atacantes misteriosos y escapa.",
        "[[pokemon::Detective Pikachu]] is injured. He asks you to get help from his friend near Cerulean Cave":
        "[[pokemon::Detective Pikachu]] está herido. Te pide que busques la ayuda de su amigo cerca de la Cueva Celeste",
        "Confront Howard Clifford in Goldenrod City about his involvement with the R vials.":
        "Enfrenta a Howard Clifford en Ciudad Trigal sobre su implicación con La Sustancia R.",
        "Defeat Howard's bodyguard and escape.":
        "Derrota al guardaespaldas de Howard y escapa.",
        "Give Howard Clifford one last chance to surrender!":
        "¡Dale a Howard Clifford una última oportunidad para rendirse!",
        "Defeat [[pokemon::Mewtwo]] to free it from Howard's control!":
        "Derrota a [[pokemon::Mewtwo]] para liberarlo del control de Howard.",
        "Talk to [[pokemon::Mewtwo]] near Cerulean Cave about [[pokemon::Detective Pikachu]]'s partner.":
