        "Defeat Ryuki to get the Memory back.":
        "Derrota a Ryuki para recuperar el Recuerdo.",
        "Go talk to Gladion in the Aether Foundation and tell him you've recovered all the Silvally Memories!":
        "Habla con Gladion en la Fundación Æther y cuéntale que recuperaste todos los Recuerdos de Silvally.",

        //Ultra Beast Hunt"

